        "testata": "South China Morning Post",
        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "Over 800,000 Lebanese – 1 in 7 of the population – displaced by war in 10 days",
        "testo_it": "Oltre 800.000 libanesi sfollati in 10 giorni a causa del conflitto in corso.",
        "priorita": "Alta",
        "id_gruppo": 3,
        "link": "https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3346678/over-800000-lebanese-1-7-population-displaced-war-10-days?utm_source=rss_feed",
        "orario": "14:54",
        "timestamp": 1773582863,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Advertisement US, Israel war on Iran World Middle East Over 800,000 Lebanese – 1 in 7 of the population – displaced by war in 10 days It is little more than a year since the last conflict uprooted over a million Lebanese from their homes, although that process took months 4 -MIN READ 4 -MIN Listen Associated Press Published: 9:54pm, 15 Mar 2026 Fatima Nazha slept on the street for two days after she and her family fled their home in Beirut’s southern suburbs following an Israeli mass evacuation order. All of the schools the government turned into shelters were full, and the family could not afford a hotel or a flat, so she and her husband eventually moved into a tent in the country’s biggest stadium while their kids and grandchildren found shelter near the southern coastal city of Sidon. In just 10 days, more than 800,000 people in Lebanon have been displaced by war, just over a year since the last conflict uprooted over a million Lebanese from their homes. Advertisement That is one in every seven people in the tiny country, according to humanitarian organisation the Norwegian Refugee Council. Many do not have a place to stay, and the cash-strapped government has only been able to accommodate roughly 120,000 people as it scrambles to open shelters and bring in more supplies. Nazha, who uses a wheelchair, said being forced from her home has been far more difficult this time than when Israel and Hezbollah were last at war more than a year ago. Advertisement Advertisement Select Voice Select Speed 00:00 00:00 1.00"
